@file Compfiles/Imo1986P6.lean
@decl Imo1986P6.balanced_of_alone_col
-- L4DEL: title: Case A: some point `P` is the only point of `S` in its column
-- L4DEL: intuition: Case A: some point `P` is the only point of `S` in its column. Then any balanced signing of `S.erase P` can be extended to a balanced signing of `S` by choosing the sign of `P` so as to balance the row of `P`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

