-- L4DEL: intuition: An edge coloring of the complete graph on 9 vertices by two colors (encoded as `Fin 2`), where some edges may be left uncolored (`none`). The vertices are indexed by `Fin 9` and the edges by unordered pairs `Sym2 (Fin 9)`; the geometric hypotheses of the problem (9 points in space, no 4 of them coplanar) only serve to guarantee that every pair of points determines an edge, so the problem is purely combinatorial.
