@decl Imo1993P3.purge
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: purge
-- L4DEL: intuition: The key purge: three consecutive pieces `p, p + u, p + u + u` in a line can be removed from the board (everything else unchanged) using a catalyst piece at `p + w` provided the square `p - w` is empty. The sequence is: `p + w` jumps over `p` to `p - w`; `p + u + u` jumps over `p + u` to `p`; `p - w` jumps over `p` to `p + w`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

