@file Compfiles/Imo2004P3.lean
@decl Imo2004P3.pair_check
-- L4DEL: title: The key local fact
-- L4DEL: intuition: The key local fact. Suppose two disjoint hooks are such that the hole of the first one is covered by the second one, and moreover the hole of the second hook is either covered by the first hook or can be covered by a third hook disjoint from both (as must happen in any tiling of a rectangle). Then the hole of the second hook is covered by the first, and the union of the two hooks is one of the six tiles. (Checked case by case.)
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

