@file Compfiles/Imo2026P4.lean
@decl Imo2026P4.good_wins
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: good_wins
-- L4DEL: intuition: A triangle (with sum 180 and positive angles) containing a positive integer multiple `k * θ` of `θ` is winning for Mulan, by induction on `k`: if `k ≥ 2`, transfer one `θ` from the apex `k * θ` to the angle `C`; the child `{C, 180 - C - θ, θ}` already contains `θ`, and the other child contains `(k - 1) * θ`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

