@file Compfiles/Imo2026P4.lean
@decl Imo2026P4.IsCut
-- L4DEL: title: One admissible cut of the triangle `s`, producing children `L` and `R`
-- L4DEL: intuition: One admissible cut of the triangle `s`, producing children `L` and `R`. We pick an apex angle `α` and the two base angles `β, γ` (so `s = {α, β, γ}`), and a cut parameter `x` in the open interval `(γ, 180 - β)`. The resulting two triangles have angle multisets `L = {β, x, 180 - β - x}` and `R = {γ, 180 - x, x - γ}`. Ranging over all `α, β, γ` with `s = {α, β, γ}` captures all three apex choices and both assignments of the two base angles.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

