@file Compfiles/Usa1973P5.lean
@decl Usa1973P5.cube_root_pqr_ne_rat
-- L4DEL: title: The cube root of a product of three pairwise distinct primes is irrational: it cannot be written as a quotient of two integers
-- L4DEL: intuition: The cube root of a product of three pairwise distinct primes is irrational: it cannot be written as a quotient of two integers. Indeed, from `∛(pqr) = A / B` we would get `p * q * r * B³ = A³` in `ℕ`, contradicting `not_cube_mul_cube`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

