-- L4DEL: intuition: A 4 x 6 coloring with no monochromatic rectangle. Written row by row, with `true` = red: ``` R B R B R B R B B R B R B R R B B R B R B R R B ``` Every column has two red and two blue squares, and no two columns have their red squares in the same two rows or their blue squares in the same two rows, so there can be no monochromatic rectangle.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

