@file Compfiles/Usa1976P1.lean
@decl Usa1976P1.two_le_card_monoTriples
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: two_le_card_monoTriples
-- L4DEL: intuition: In any column of 4 squares colored with 2 colors, if `k` squares are red then `4 - k` are blue, so the number of monochromatic pairs of squares is `k.choose 2 + (4 - k).choose 2 ≥ 1 + 1 = 2`. There are only 16 possible columns, so we check them all.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

