-- L4DEL: intuition: The finite check over all `3^10` assignments, evaluated by kernel reduction. The enumeration is stated as ten nested quantifiers over `Link` — three choices each — so that the reduction stays shallow. The first four variables are case-split before the kernel reduction, so that the kernel only ever enumerates `3^6 = 729` assignments at a time; this keeps the peak elaboration memory low.
