-- L4DEL: intuition: Key covering step of the solution: writing each set of the family as `Icc (a i) (b i) ∪ Icc (c i) (d i)`, every set contains either `a h`, where `h` maximizes the left endpoint `a`, or `d k`, where `k` minimizes the right endpoint `d`. Otherwise a common point of `S i`, `S h` and `S k` would have to lie left of `a h` inside `S h`, or right of `d k` inside `S k`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

