@file Compfiles/Usa1985P5.lean
@decl Usa1985P5.sum_eq
-- L4DEL: title: The key identity: the sum is *constant*
-- L4DEL: intuition: The key identity: the sum is *constant*. Double-count the pairs `(i, j) ∈ range 19 × range 85`: for each pair, exactly one of `j < a i` and `i < c a hu (j+1)` holds, so the two indicator sums add up to `19 * 85`; the extra `+ 1` in each `b` term contributes another `85`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

