-- L4DEL: title: The lower bound `b(n) ≥ n(n - 2)/7`: double-counting pairs of a possible block position and a torn-out block meeting it
-- L4DEL: intuition: The lower bound `b(n) ≥ n(n - 2)/7`: double-counting pairs of a possible block position and a torn-out block meeting it. Every one of the `2n(n - 2)` positions must be met by the tearing, and every torn-out block meets at most `14` positions.
