@file Compfiles/Usa2004P2.lean
@decl Usa2004P2.all_linear_comb
-- L4DEL: title: Second lemma of the informal proof: every integer linear combination of the generators lies in `S`
-- L4DEL: intuition: Second lemma of the informal proof: every integer linear combination of the generators lies in `S`. Proved by strong induction on the finset `T`: vanishing coefficients are simply removed, an even coefficient allows the `even_split` step, and if all coefficients are odd one first perturbs two of them using `u * a q = v * a p` (where `u = a p / gcd a p a q`, `v = a q / gcd a p a q`) to manufacture an even coefficient.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

