@file Compfiles/Usa2004P4.lean
@decl Usa2004P4.usa2004_p4
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: usa2004_p4
-- L4DEL: intuition: **USAMO 2004, Problem 4.** Bob (the second player) has a winning strategy: whenever the play follows Bob's strategy `σ` of answering a move in the first two rows by a suitable number in the paired cell (and playing anywhere in rows 3 to 6 otherwise), the final board has no black path from the top row to the bottom row, so Alice cannot win.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

