-- L4DEL: intuition: The subtractive Euclidean algorithm on one pair of positions. If the values at positions `i` and `j` are positive integer multiples `p * t` and `q * t` of a common positive real `t`, then by repeatedly erasing the larger of the two we can reach a board containing `0`.
