-- L4DEL: intuition: The upper bound: every coset contains an element of weight at most `6 * (n / 4) + n % 4`. The proof averages the eight coset weights (their sum is always `12n`), with a parity refinement when `n % 4 ∈ {2, 3}`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

