@decl Usa2013P4.Distinguished
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: Distinguished
-- L4DEL: intuition: The condition that `x` is the "distinguished" coordinate of a solution (the coordinate at which the minimum of the left-hand side is attained): the other two shifted coordinates `y - 1`, `z - 1` multiply to `1`, and `x - 1` is the reciprocal of `(√(y - 1) + √(z - 1))²`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file Compfiles/Usa2013P4.lean
@decl Usa2013P4.eq_conds
-- L4DEL: title: Equality conditions: if `(1+u)(1+(1+v)(1+w)) = (√u + √v + √w)²` for nonnegative `u, v, w`, then `v * w = 1` and `u * (√v + √w)² = 1`
-- L4DEL: intuition: Equality conditions: if `(1+u)(1+(1+v)(1+w)) = (√u + √v + √w)²` for nonnegative `u, v, w`, then `v * w = 1` and `u * (√v + √w)² = 1`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file Compfiles/Usa2013P4.lean
@decl Usa2013P4.key_identity
