@file Compfiles/Usa2016P1.lean
@decl Usa2016P1.not_hasChain_seven
-- L4DEL: title: The main combinatorial estimate: no chain exists on a 7-element set
-- L4DEL: intuition: The main combinatorial estimate: no chain exists on a 7-element set. Sets of size at least 4 must be preceded by sets of size at most 2, and there are only 28 nonempty subsets of size at most 2 and 35 subsets of size 3, so a chain on 7 elements has length at most `28 + 35 + (28 + 1) = 92 < 100`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

