-- L4DEL: intuition: An explicit chain of 100 subsets of an 8-element set. (Obtained from the inductive construction of the official solution: start from the chain `34, 1, 23, 4, 12, 3, 14, 2, 13` on a 4-element set and repeatedly duplicate the chain, glue the two copies together with the empty set in between, and insert a new element into alternating positions.)
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

