@file Compfiles/Usa2019P6.lean
@decl Usa2019P6.Qfun
-- L4DEL: title: The polynomial equation, multiplied through by `xyz`
-- L4DEL: intuition: The polynomial equation, multiplied through by `xyz`. This is the form of the hypothesis that we use below: it says that `Q(x, y, z)` vanishes, where `Q(x, y, z) = xP(x) + yP(y) + zP(z) − xyz (P(x−y) + P(y−z) + P(z−x))`.
