@decl Usa2025P5.choose_cast_zmod
-- L4DEL: title: The key congruence: if the prime power `p ^ e` divides `n + 1` and `p * M = n + 1`, then `n.choose i ≡ (-1) ^ (i - i / p) * (M - 1).choose (i / p)` modulo `p ^ e`
-- L4DEL: intuition: The key congruence: if the prime power `p ^ e` divides `n + 1` and `p * M = n + 1`, then `n.choose i ≡ (-1) ^ (i - i / p) * (M - 1).choose (i / p)` modulo `p ^ e`.
